[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_1]
Appleloosa Protest Against the Second Ag-reform

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_1_desc]
On the day after the announcement of the second agriculture reform plan in Ponyville, Appleloosa has issued a strong protest. The Apple family said that the first ag-reform was a disaster - the mass felling of apple trees and the planting of other tree species was nothing but a blatant persecution of the Apple family, and ultimately led to tragic results.
Braeburn, district head of Appleloosa has made a strong statement, saying that he cannot accept “a second persecution” of the Apple family in Ponyville’s territory, and threatened that if Ponyville does not withdraw this plan, Appleloosa will take all necessary measures to protect its interests, including economic sanctions such as terminating the Appleloosa-Ponyville trade agreement.

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_1_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_2]
Appleloosa terminates trade agreement with Ponyville

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_2_desc]
Recently, the trade agreement between Appleloosa and Ponyville has been terminated. This decision is in response to Ponyville’s announcement of a second agricultural reform plan. Lady Terecexy Lulamoon, the lord of Ponyville, expressed her pity.

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_2_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_3]
The Second Ponyville Agricultural Revolution

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_3_desc]
The second agricultural reform officially began to be implemented, and many places such as Ponyville, Apple Farm, and Pear Farm began to cut down and replace existing tree species.
Thanks to the “Super Speedy Cider Squeezy 6000” sold by the Flim Flam brothers, the speed of tree felling has been greatly improved, and the juice can be bottled directly. While reforming, a large amount of fuel and juice can be harvested — of course, the juice will be used for export.
Applejack called it a crime against apple trees.

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_3_o0]
... while we would call it efficient

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_4]
Unavoidable War

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_4_desc]
After the Manehattan War, the Empire has repeatedly condemned and imposed multiple sanctions on the Starlight Resistance. But obviously, these cannot stop the expansion and integration of Eastern Equestria.
Reporters from the Equestria Daily of the Empire have photographed the military factories of the Resistance running at full speed. In many regions such as Ponyville and Baltimare, soldiers are training on the training ground. Facing the camera of the reporter, these ponies do not even conceal it, but directly tell the reporter that they must report the news to the entire Equestria. “We want to tell the Empire that we are ready to take back everything that belonged to us! For freedom, for friendship!” A interviewed factory worker pony said.

Once the report was released, Empress Cozy Glow immediately ordered the Empire’s army to gather at the border to prepare for defense. However, contrary to expectations, although Empress Cozy Glow frequently and intensively spoke to eradicate the Starlight rebels, she has not yet issued a declaration of war, until today. The Empress had a phone call with Trixie, appointing Trixie as the “Marshal of the Equestria Empire” and issued a special order of honor: Duke of Ponyville will lead the Empire to send troops to eradicate the rebels.

This day, has finally come.

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_4_o0]
Alas...

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_4_o1]
Bring the bloodshed on!

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_5]
Trixie Re-elected!

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_5_desc]
The second Ponyville election has ended, and Trixie has been re-elected as the Duchess of Ponyville, without any suspense.

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_5_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_6]
Octavia Elected!

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_6_desc]
The second Ponyville election has ended, and Octavia has been elected as the new Duchess of Ponyville. Trixie will step down in the coming days and will fully support a peaceful transition.
Octavia believes that peace is the only future for Ponyville. Octavia promises to bring more peace to the residents of Ponyville, and more music as well.

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_6_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_7]
Mare Elected!

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_7_desc]
The second Ponyville election has ended, and Mare has been elected as the new Duchess of Ponyville. Trixie will step down in the coming days and will fully support a peaceful transition.
Mare is an experienced politician, and the residents believe she is capable of managing Ponyville well, just like she did before.

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_7_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_8]
Dr. Hooves Elected!

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_8_desc]
The second Ponyville election has ended, and Dr. Hooves has been elected as the new Duchess of Ponyville. Trixie will step down in the coming days and will fully support a peaceful transition.
Dr. Hooves is a capable pony, but his relationship with the Duchess of Cloudsdale, Derpy Hooves, may be controversial. Or, shall we say, attention-grabbing?

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_8_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_9]
Filthy Rich Elected!

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_9_desc]
The second Ponyville election has ended, and Filthy Rich has been elected as the new Duchess of Ponyville. Trixie will step down in the coming days and has refused to comment on the matter.
Filthy Rich has no particular faith, and his policies are determined by his business interests. But who is Filthy Rich’s biggest patron now?

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_9_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_10]
Crackle Cosette Elected!

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_10_desc]
The second Ponyville election has ended, and Crackle Cosette has been elected as the new Duchess of Ponyville.
Who?

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_10_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_11]
Trixie Fired!

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_11_desc]
Due to the continued low approval ratings of Duchess Trixie, the Empress of Equestria Empire, Cozy Glow, has announced that, in order to comply with public opinion, Trixie will be dismissed from the position of Duchess and replaced by a new Duke/Duchess. Ponyville will immediately begin a new round of Duke/Duchess election.
The Empire’s spokespony said that this move is the best embodiment of the harmony and democracy of the Equestria Empire, and the residents of Ponyville should be grateful for the wise decision of Empress Cozy Glow and continue to firmly support the development of the Empire.

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_11_o0]
It’s over...

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_11_o1]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_11_EFFECT_TOOLTIP]
§RTrixie Lulamoon will be dismissed from office and imprisoned§!.
Hold §YThe Second Ponyville Election§!.

§RIn the current version, this means it’s game over...§!

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_12]
Trixie’s support rate is low!

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_12_desc]
Trixe’s low support rate is a dangerous signal.

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_12_o0]
Be careful...

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_12_TOOLTIP]
If this situation is not quickly improved, it may lead to Trixie being §Rimpeached§! and an early §YThe Second Ponyville Election§!.

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_13]
Great and Powerful...?

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_13_desc]
The square in front of the town hall was crowded with ponies, waiting for the Duchess, the Great and Powerful Trixie, to perform her first public magic show since her return to the magic world.
Of course, not all of the audience were her fans. There were also the employees of the Ponyville government, the envoys and spies of the Empire, foreign merchants who wanted to do business with the Duchess, and political opponents who were waiting to see her make a fool of herself.

As the lights suddenly went out, Trixie’s voice rang out, echoing in the darkness as if it had come from another world.
“Welcome! My friends of Ponyville, I am the Great and Powerful Trixie. Tonight, I will not be answering your complaints on the phone, nor will I be giving you orders. Tonight, I am just a magician.”
Then, the colored lights danced up and down, the sound of fireworks echoed through the night sky, and flames shot up as if it were daytime. Trixie’s performance began. From card tricks, to pulling rabbits out of hats, to sawing ponies in half, she won rounds of applause and cheers.
When it was time for the grand finale, Trixie performed a brand new magic trick she had designed for this show - the Mind-Reading Escape from the Box. She randomly selected a lucky audience member - Lyra. Lyra locked Trixie in the box and interacted with the audience to choose a set of numbers. Then Trixie would escape from the box, which was locked layer by layer, and guess the numbers chosen by the audience. This was a piece of cake for Trixie - because Lyra was her “secret helper” she had arranged in advance.

Everything went very smoothly. Trixie accurately read out the numbers chosen by Lyra and the audience, and took her bow amidst thunderous applause. And just as she was about to take her bow, perhaps Lyra’s cooperation was too perfect, Trixie was reminded of a certain pony she had worked with before, and she almost read it out loud: “And thanks to this lucky audience member who came up to help with the show, Sta——”
At that moment, she froze completely, sweating all over, her eyes wide open, as if looking for the Empire spy among the audience. She forced herself to calm down, “——standing next to me, Miss Lyra! Thank you to all the audience! Thank you...” Trixie couldn’t think clearly about what she was saying anymore, and hurriedly took her bow to prepare to leave the stage. In the midst of the confusion, she accidentally tripped over her magic robe and fell to the ground. Her magic hat fell off, and a small piece of paper fell out of it - the note Lyra had secretly passed to her with the numbers written on it, which was clearly seen by the audience in the front row.

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_13_o0]
Really messed up

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_14]
Magic Improvement

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_14_desc]
After the failed magic show, Duchess Trixie’s street name, from “Trixie”, “Her Grace”, “The Great and Powerful Trixie” and so on, was unified into “Third-class Magician Trixie”.

Trixie is not the kind of pony who cares about the ridicule of other ponies. In the past, she should have been tough and sarcastic to those who ridiculed her, and challenged them to see her next, greater, more powerful magic show. But this time, she didn’t. It took her a long time to get rid of the inexplicable irritability, and to continue her normal life, work, and magic research.
Just because of that failure? Trixie thought, maybe her whole life is like that magic show — carefully doing everything well while hiding herself, hiding from the audience, hiding from the spies of the Empire. Beyond that, she also needs to avoid the name that cannot be mentioned, and avoid her own past. If this analogy is established, some day in the future of her fate, she will probably trip over and fell to the ground as well.

But if she don’t consider the long-term and elusive so-called “fate”, improving the magic trick is a piece of cake for Trixie. One day, when she returned to the wagon, untied her clothes, and took off the brooch she bought from the Saddle Arabia, the one which once belonged to a pair of brooches, she remembered that she had seen a kind of code in a magazine in Diamondia, where the two parties communicated by wearing gemstone jewelry in different positions, angles, and ways. If she and Lyra’s little notes were replaced by conveying numbers through the reflection of jewelry, maybe she wouldn’t be discovered.

“I am really such a great and powerful genius —”

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_14_o0]
“— am I right, Starlight?”

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_15]
Ponyville Hay Burger Store Goes International

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_15_desc]
Today, the newly opened Ponyville Hay Burger Store in Manehattan has attracted the attention of the entire Manehattan celebrities. Although hay burgers are not considered noble food, the Ponyville Hay Burger Store is definitely different.
The Ponyville Hay Burger Store has been in business in Ponyville for decades, and almost every resident of Ponyville has enjoyed hay burgers here, and has been so for a long time.
Until a few months ago, the Ponyville government proposed the slogan of developing local brands in Ponyville. With the support of the Duchess’s own money and government policy support, the Ponyville Hay Burger Store opened its first branch at the Dodge Junction.
Subsequently, the Ponyville Hay Burger Store was a great success, and the chain stores spread rapidly in Eastern Equestria like the orange spots on the ponies with cutie pox. From the south of Horseshoe Bay to Fillydelphia, and then to the north of Manehattan, there is the always a Ponyville Hay Burger Store. Soon, the Ponyville Hay Burger Store will also be stationed in Canterlot, and even more wild, Appleloosa, Trottingham, Sire’s Hollow, and Crystal Square!
Now, Trixie comes to the Ponyville headquarters every month, in front of all the media, wearing formal government work clothes, combing her hair and wearing a brooch, rolling up the napkin, elegantly tasting a hay burger, smiling to the crowd, to show support for the Ponyville Hay Burger Store.
What a miraculous story!

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_15_o0]
“If I had known that making burgers would make so much money, I might not have been a Duchess.”

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_15_o1]
Emm...

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_16]
Dodge College has been approved!

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_16_desc]
We have obtained the certification of EEA! Dodge Junction College will start recruiting students and more teachers!

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_16_o0]
Good!

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_17]
Dodge College is not approved

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_17_desc]
We are not approved by EEA for now, but we will keep working on it!

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_17_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_18]
Hidden Event: College Review

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_18_desc]
Hidden Event: College Review

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_18_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_19]
Starlight Hay Burger Store

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_19_desc]
After the great success of the Manehattan Hay Burger Store, more and more Ponyville Hay Burger Store franchise stores have sprung up in Eastern Equestria like mushrooms after rain. This also provides an excellent opportunity.
Due to the sudden popularity, the Ponyville Hay Burger Store has become an international brand overnight, but the management model still remains in the tradition of Ponyville, because they do not know how to deal with this sudden change.
This has led to the extremely chaotic transfer of Ponyville Hay Burger Store employees. We can easily plant our agents in these franchise stores in batches, waiting to be transferred back to the Ponyville headquarters. In this way, we can easily infiltrate Ponyville, collect the Empire’s intelligence, and even — contact Trixie.

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_19_o0]
Yum-yum!

[en.EVENT_C02_MAIN_19_TOOLTIP]
§Y[C08.GetName]§! will gain access to internal intel of the §Y[C01.GetName]§!.
From now on we will start to receive internal reports (some country events) from the §Y[C01.GetName]§!.

§gOf course, this may just be some documents that some Ponyville officials or even Empire officials accidentally left (stolen) in the hay burger shop when they were eating hay burgers.§!

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_1]
苹果鲁萨抗议小马谷二次农改

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_1_desc]
在小马谷宣布计划进行第二次农业改革的次日，苹果鲁萨方面就发出了强烈抗议。苹果家族表示，第一次农业改革就是一场灾难——批量砍伐苹果树改种其他树种是对苹果家族的一次公然迫害，最终也造成了悲剧的结果。
苹果鲁萨区长布雷本强硬表态，不能接受小马谷对领地内的苹果家族进行“第二次迫害”，并威胁称，若小马谷不撤回这一计划，苹果鲁萨将采取一切必要措施维护自己的利益，包括对终止苹果鲁萨-小马谷贸易协定等经济制裁。

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_1_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_2]
苹果鲁萨与小马谷终止贸易协定

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_2_desc]
近日，苹果鲁萨与小马谷之间的贸易协定被终止。这一决定是苹果鲁萨方面对小马谷宣布进行第二次农业改革计划的回应。小马谷领主特丽克西·卢拉月对此表示遗憾。

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_2_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_3]
第二次小马谷农业改革

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_3_desc]
第二次农业改革正式开始推行，小马谷、苹果农场、梨农场等多地都开始了对已有树种的砍伐和更换。
多亏了油嘴滑舌兄弟出售的“超级快速苹果榨汁机6000”，如今的果树砍伐速度大大提高，而且还能直接将果汁装瓶，在改革的同时收获大量燃料和果汁——当然，果汁将用于出口。
苹果鲁萨将其称为对苹果树的犯罪。

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_3_o0]
... 而我们将其称为高效

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_4]
无法避免的战争

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_4_desc]
马哈顿战争结束后，帝国对星光抵抗军进行了多次谴责和多轮制裁。但很显然，这些并不能阻止抵抗军的扩张与对东小马利亚的整合。
小马利亚帝国日报记者在小马德菲亚、马哈顿等多个地区拍摄到抵抗军的军工厂在全速运转，士兵们在训练场上进行着操练。面对记者的镜头，这些小马们甚至毫不掩饰，反而直接了当地对记者表示，务必将新闻报道给整个小马利亚。“我们要告诉帝国，我们已经准备好夺回属于我们的一切了！为了自由，为了友谊！” 一名接受采访的军工厂工马如是说。

报道一经发出，和煦光流女皇立刻下令，调集帝国军队在边境集结准备防守。然而，不同于外界的预期，尽管和煦光流女皇频繁密集讲话要剿灭星光叛军，但却迟迟没有下达宣战令。直到今日，女皇与特丽克西进行了一次电话会谈，将特丽克西封为“小马利亚帝国元帅”，并下达了一份特别的光荣命令：小马谷公爵领将代表帝国出兵，剿灭叛军。

这一天，终于还是到来了。

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_4_o0]
唉...

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_4_o1]
我要看到血流成河！

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_5]
特丽克西连任！

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_5_desc]
第二次小马谷大选结束，特丽克西再次当选小马谷公爵，毫无悬念。

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_5_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_6]
奥塔薇娅当选！

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_6_desc]
第二次小马谷大选结束，奥塔薇娅当选新一任小马谷公爵。特丽克西将在近日内离任并将全力支持和平交接。
奥塔薇娅相信，和平是小马谷的唯一未来。奥塔薇娅向小马谷的居民承诺，将会尽力为小马谷的居民带来更多的和平，和更多的音乐。

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_6_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_7]
梅耶当选！

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_7_desc]
第二次小马谷大选结束，梅耶当选新一任小马谷公爵。特丽克西将在近日内离任并将全力支持和平交接。
梅耶是一只从政经验丰富的小马，居民们相信她有能力管理好小马谷，就像曾经一样。

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_7_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_8]
蹄博士当选！

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_8_desc]
第二次小马谷大选结束，蹄博士当选新一任小马谷公爵。特丽克西将在近日内离任并将全力支持和平交接。
蹄博士是一位能力出色的小马，但是他与云中城公爵呆蹄的关系，或许会招致争议。或者说，吸引关注？

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_8_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_9]
钱多多当选！

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_9_desc]
第二次小马谷大选结束，钱多多当选新一任小马谷公爵。特丽克西将在近日内离任，对此拒绝发表评论。
钱多多没有什么信仰，施政方针取决于他的商业利益。但是——钱多多的最大金主如今是谁呢？

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_9_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_10]
爆裂甜菜当选！

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_10_desc]
第二次小马谷大选结束，爆裂甜菜当选新一任小马谷公爵。
谁？

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_10_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_11]
特丽克西被罢免！

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_11_desc]
由于公爵特丽克西的支持率持续低迷，小马利亚帝国女皇和煦光流宣布，为顺应民意，特丽克西将被罢免公爵职务，由新公爵接任。小马谷将立即开始新一轮公爵选举。
帝国发言者称，这一举措是小马利亚帝国和谐、民主的最好体现，小马谷的居民应该感激女皇和煦光流的英明决策，并继续坚定支持帝国的发展。

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_11_o0]
结束了...

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_11_o1]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_11_EFFECT_TOOLTIP]
§R特丽克西·卢拉月将被免除职务，关入监狱§!。
举行§Y第二届小马谷大选§!。

§R在当前的版本中，这意味着已经游戏结束了...§!

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_12]
特丽克西支持率低迷！

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_12_desc]
特丽克西的支持率保持低迷，这是一个危险的信号。

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_12_o0]
小心...

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_12_TOOLTIP]
如果不快速改善这一状态，可能会导致特丽克西被§R罢免§!并提前举行§Y第二届小马谷大选§!。

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_13]
伟大又全能...？

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_13_desc]
夜晚的市政厅前马头攒动，无数小马在市政厅前等待着公爵殿下，伟大又全能的特丽克西女士，进行她在魔术界复出的第一次公开表演。
当然，下面的观众中也不全是她的粉丝，还有小马谷政府的员工，帝国的使者和间谍，想要与公爵谈生意的外国商队，以及等着看她笑话的政治对手。

随着灯光突然熄灭，特丽克西的声音响起，她的声音在黑暗中回荡，仿佛是从另一个世界传来的。
“欢迎，小马谷的朋友们，我是伟大又全能的特丽克西。今晚，我不会接听你们的投诉电话，也不对你们发号施令。今晚，我只是一个魔术师。”
随后，彩色灯光上下飞舞，礼炮声响彻夜空，火焰喷射宛如白昼，特丽克西的表演开始了。从纸牌魔术，到变兔子，再到切马魔术，赢得了阵阵鼓蹄声和欢呼声。
到了压轴节目的时间，特丽克西为本次表演全新设计的魔术——密箱逃脱读心术。她随机抽取了一名幸运观众——天琴。天琴将特丽克西锁在箱子内，并和观众们互动选择一组数字，随后特丽克西将从层层封锁的箱子中逃脱，并猜出观众们选择的数字。这对特丽克西来说易如反掌——因为天琴是她提前请好的“托”。

一切进行的非常顺利，特丽克西准确地大声念出了天琴和观众们选择的数字，在雷鸣般的欢呼声中谢幕。而就在谢幕的那一刻，也许是天琴的配合太过完美，让特丽克西想起了之前合作的某只小马，她差点大声地念了出来：“也要感谢这位上台配合演出的幸运观众，星g——”
那一瞬间她完全凝固住了，全身冒汗，她的眼睛瞪得大大的，似乎在寻找观众中的帝国间谍。她强装镇定，“——兴高采烈的天琴女士！也谢谢各位观众！感谢...”特丽克西已经想不清楚自己在说什么了，慌慌张张地谢幕准备下台，而在这慌乱中她又不小心踩到了自己的魔术袍，绊倒在地上。她的魔术帽掉落，从里面掉出了一张小纸条——天琴偷偷递给她的写着那串数字的纸条，被第一排的观众看得清清楚楚。

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_13_o0]
搞砸了

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_14]
魔术改进

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_14_desc]
那次失败的魔术表演之后，特丽克西公爵在街头的称呼，从不同小马口中的“特丽克西”、“公爵殿下”、“伟大又全能的特丽克西”等等，统一变成了“三流魔术师特丽克西”。

特丽克西并不是那种会在乎其他小马嘲笑的小马，往日里的她应该会嘴硬并阴阳怪气那些嘲笑她的小马，并挑战他们问他们敢不敢来看自己的下一场，更伟大，更全能的魔术表演。而这次，她却没有这样做。她花了很长时间才摆脱了那股莫名的烦躁，重新继续正常生活、工作、研究魔术。
只是因为那次失败么？特丽克西想，也许她的整个生活也如那次魔术表演一模一样——小心翼翼地做好每一件事的同时还要隐藏自己，对观众隐藏，对帝国的间谍隐藏。在这之外，她还需要躲避那个不能提起的名字，和躲避自己的过去。如果这样的类比成立的话，估计她的命运也会在将来某一天绊倒在地上吧。

但是如果不去考虑那么长远而虚无缥缈的所谓“命运”，改进魔术把戏对于特丽克西来说则是小菜一碟。一天，当她回到马车，解开衣服，取下自己从鞍拉伯买来的胸针的时候，看着那本属于一对胸针中的一只，她想起曾经在宝石王国的杂志上看到过一种暗号，通信双方通过佩戴宝石首饰的不同位置、角度、佩戴方式，向对方传达信息。如果她和天琴的小纸条换成通过首饰的反光来传达数字的话，也许就不会被发现了吧。

“我真是个伟大又全能的天才——”

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_14_o0]
“——你说对吧，星光？”

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_15]
小马谷汉堡店走向国际

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_15_desc]
今日，马哈顿新开业的小马谷汉堡店吸引了整个马哈顿名流的目光。虽说干草汉堡算不上什么高贵的食物，但小马谷汉堡店绝对不同。
小马谷汉堡店在小马谷有着数十年的经营历史，几乎每一只小马谷的居民都在这里享用过干草汉堡，长久以来都是如此。
直到几个月前，小马谷政府提出发展小马谷地方品牌的口号，在据说是公爵自掏腰包的资助和政府政策支持下，小马谷汉堡店在道奇路口开设了第一家分店。
随后，小马谷汉堡店大获成功，连锁店也像得了可爱标志瘤的小马身上的橙色斑点一样在东小马利亚迅速蔓延，从南边的马蹄湾到小马德菲亚，再到北边的马哈顿，都有了小马谷汉堡店的身影。也许很快，小马谷汉堡店也将进驻坎特洛特，甚至更狂野一点，苹果鲁萨、驼丁汉、名流谷和水晶广场！小马谷汉堡店不仅获得了巨大的利润，也带动了小马谷经济的发展，游客们也纷纷慕名而来。
如今，特丽克西每个月都会来到小马谷总店，当着所有媒体的面，穿着正式的政府工作服，梳起头发戴着胸针，卷好餐巾，优雅地品尝一次干草汉堡，一边向群众微笑示意，以表示对小马谷汉堡店的支持。
真是一个奇迹的故事！

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_15_o0]
“如果早知道做汉堡这么赚钱，我可能就不当公爵了”

[zh.EVENT_C02_MAIN_15_o1]
额...

